  "translation": "Na ol i singautim krai bilong hangan long yu, na ol i tokim yu: Bilong wanem yu lus gut! Siti we ol man bilong solwara i save stap long en, siti we ol i save praizim, we i bin strong long solwara — em na ol man bilong en, ol man we ol i givim sikaut bilong ol long olgeta man bilong en!",
